ving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017144638\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.062 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.085 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 582/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4253/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 320/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 13486/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   20.106      1 -total\n 38.64%    7.768      1 Template:AMC10_box\n 36.02%    7.242      1 Template:AMC12_box\n 24.04%    4.834      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2932:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017144638 and revision id 256752. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}